OL,3,AHyrox athlete sparks debate for
OL,4,Acontinuing race after soiling herself
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn athlete's Hyrox performance has
OL,7,Fsparked debate after completing a race
OL,8,Fin Beijing despite soiling herself
OL,9,Fmidway through the event.
OL,11,FFootage of the woman competing in the
OL,12,Findoor fitness competition despite her
OL,13,Fsoiled legs has gone viral, with some
OL,14,Fpeople raising concerns around hygiene
OL,15,Fand others saluting her resolve to push
OL,16,Fthrough. Some also criticised race
OL,17,Forganisers for letting her to continue.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
