OL,3,AHyrox athlete sparks debate for
OL,4,Acontinuing race after soiling herself
OL,5,
OL,6,FHyrox said they launched a "major
OL,7,Fcleanup operation" after the event on
OL,8,FSaturday, including by sanitising
OL,9,Fequipment and replacing sections of the
OL,10,Fcarpet.
OL,12,FThe German fitness company acknowledged
OL,13,Fthe "legitimate concerns" but urged
OL,14,Fpeople not to direct their frustration
OL,15,Fat the athlete herself.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
